  "Spread evenly across the slide, horizontally": ["スライド全体に左右に均等配置","在幻灯片上横向均匀分布","在投影片上水平均勻分佈","Repartir uniformemente en la diapositiva, en horizontal","Répartir uniformément sur la diapositive, horizontalement","Horizontal gleichmäßig über die Folie verteilen","Distribuisci uniformemente sulla diapositiva, in orizzontale","Distribuir uniformemente pelo slide, na horizontal"],
  "Spread evenly across the slide, vertically": ["スライド全体に上下に均等配置","在幻灯片上纵向均匀分布","在投影片上垂直均勻分佈","Repartir uniformemente en la diapositiva, en vertical","Répartir uniformément sur la diapositive, verticalement","Vertikal gleichmäßig über die Folie verteilen","Distribuisci uniformemente sulla diapositiva, in verticale","Distribuir uniformemente pelo slide, na vertical"],
