  "Close Slide Sorter to open the Layout Manager": ["Layout Manager を開くにはスライド一覧を閉じてください","关闭幻灯片浏览以打开 Layout Manager","關閉投影片瀏覽以開啟 Layout Manager","Cierra el Clasificador de diapositivas para abrir el Layout Manager","Fermez la Trieuse de diapositives pour ouvrir le Layout Manager","Schließen Sie die Foliensortierung, um den Layout Manager zu öffnen","Chiudi Sequenza diapositive per aprire Layout Manager","Feche o Classificador de slides para abrir o Layout Manager"],
  "Close Outline View to open the Layout Manager": ["Layout Manager を開くにはアウトライン表示を閉じてください","关闭大纲视图以打开 Layout Manager","關閉大綱檢視以開啟 Layout Manager","Cierra la Vista de esquema para abrir el Layout Manager","Fermez le mode Plan pour ouvrir le Layout Manager","Schließen Sie die Gliederungsansicht, um den Layout Manager zu öffnen","Chiudi Visualizzazione struttura per aprire Layout Manager","Feche o modo Tópicos para abrir o Layout Manager"],
