  "Add Claude Code profile": ["Claude Code プロファイルを追加","添加 Claude Code 配置","新增 Claude Code 設定檔","Añadir perfil de Claude Code","Ajouter un profil Claude Code","Claude-Code-Profil hinzufügen","Aggiungi profilo Claude Code","Adicionar perfil do Claude Code"],
