  "Import shell functions": ["シェル関数をインポート","导入 shell 函数","匯入 shell 函式","Importar funciones del shell","Importer les fonctions shell","Shell-Funktionen importieren","Importa funzioni shell","Importar funções do shell"],
  "Finds your claude-* shell functions (claude-work, …) and offers each as a profile": ["claude-* シェル関数（claude-work など）を探し、それぞれをプロファイルとして追加できます","查找你的 claude-* shell 函数（claude-work 等），并把每个作为配置提供","尋找你的 claude-* shell 函式（claude-work 等），並將每個提供為設定檔","Busca sus funciones de shell claude-* (claude-work, …) y ofrece cada una como perfil","Trouve vos fonctions shell claude-* (claude-work, …) et propose chacune comme profil","Findet Ihre claude-*-Shell-Funktionen (claude-work, …) und bietet jede als Profil an","Trova le vostre funzioni shell claude-* (claude-work, …) e propone ciascuna come profilo","Encontra as suas funções de shell claude-* (claude-work, …) e oferece cada uma como perfil"],
  "No new claude-* shell functions found": ["新しい claude-* シェル関数は見つかりませんでした","未找到新的 claude-* shell 函数","找不到新的 claude-* shell 函式","No se encontraron funciones de shell claude-* nuevas","Aucune nouvelle fonction shell claude-* trouvée","Keine neuen claude-*-Shell-Funktionen gefunden","Nessuna nuova funzione shell claude-* trovata","Nenhuma função de shell claude-* nova encontrada"],
